    "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 1.1em; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n                    En este path, los módulos cubren las herramientas básicas necesarias para tener éxito en pruebas de penetración de redes y aplicaciones web. Aprender a utilizar este conjunto de herramientas básicas es fundamental.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"module-badges\" style=\"justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n                    <span class=\"badge medium\">Medium</span>\n                    <span class=\"badge duration\">6d 2h</span>\n                    <span class=\"badge duration\">7 Modules</span>\n                    <span class=\"badge duration\">60 Secciones</span>\n                    <span class=\"badge duration\">110 Cubes</span>\n                    <span class=\"badge progress\">8.6% Completado</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"module-list\">\n                <!-- Modulo 1 -->\n                <div class=\"module-card\">\n                    <div class=\"module-info\">\n                        <h3>Network Enumeration with Nmap</h3>\n                        <div class=\"module-badges\">\n                            <span class=\"badge offensive\">OFFENSIVE</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge easy\">Easy</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge duration\">7h</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge progress\">En progreso (66.67%)</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Modulo 2 -->\n                <div class=\"module-card\">\n                    <div class=\"module-info\">\n                        <h3>Login Brute Forcing</h3>\n                        <div class=\"module-badges\">\n                            <span class=\"badge offensive\">OFFENSIVE</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge easy\">Easy</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge duration\">6h</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Modulo 3 -->\n                <div class=\"module-card\">\n                    <div class=\"module-info\">\n                        <h3>Attacking Web Applications with Ffuf</h3>\n                        <div class=\"module-badges\">\n                            <span class=\"badge offensive\">OFFENSIVE</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge easy\">Easy</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge duration\">5h</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Modulo 4 -->\n                <div class=\"module-card\">\n                    <div class=\"module-info\">\n                        <h3>Cracking Passwords with Hashcat</h3>\n                        <div class=\"module-badges\">\n                            <span class=\"badge offensive\">OFFENSIVE</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge medium\">Medium</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge duration\">1d</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Modulo 5 -->\n                <div class=\"module-card\">\n                    <div class=\"module-info\">\n                        <h3>SQLMap Essentials</h3>\n                        <div class=\"module-badges\">\n                            <span class=\"badge offensive\">OFFENSIVE</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge easy\">Easy</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge duration\">1d</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Modulo 6 -->\n                <div class=\"module-card\">\n                    <div class=\"module-info\">\n                        <h3>Intro to Network Traffic Analysis</h3>\n                        <div class=\"module-badges\">\n                            <span class=\"badge general\">GENERAL</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge medium\">Medium</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge duration\">1d</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Modulo 7 -->\n                <div class=\"module-card\">\n                    <div class=\"module-info\">\n                        <h3>Using Web Proxies</h3>\n                        <div class=\"module-badges\">\n                            <span class=\"badge offensive\">OFFENSIVE</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge easy\">Easy</span>\n                            <span class=\"badge duration\">1d</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; align-items: center;\">\n                <a href=\"https://profile.hackthebox.com/profile/019e49a7-87de-70ae-888a-7ba8ec7cb57f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"btn-cv\" style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 1.1em; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #047857); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">🎯 Ver mi perfil de HackTheBox</a>\n                <a href=\"https://academy.hackthebox.com/app/paths/9/path-progress\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"btn-link\">Ver Path Progress Oficial en HackTheBox →</a>\n            </div>"
